{"id":"54bd0de31af513e7","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-baire-neighborhood-function.md","title":"Baire 空间的邻域函数与输出","display":"df-baire-neighborhood-function — Baire 空间的邻域函数与输出","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function","aliases":["72-df-baire-neighborhood-function"],"display":"df-baire-neighborhood-function — Baire 空间的邻域函数与输出","depends_on":[],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.6 class K*, print426/PDF438; finite-sequence formulation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source K* clauses and total-output well-definedness checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-baire-neighborhood-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-baire-neighborhood-function — Baire 空间的邻域函数与输出"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.6 class K*, print426/PDF438; finite-sequence formulation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source K* clauses and total-output well-definedness checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为自然数有限序列集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 为 Baire 空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^\\frown t\">\\(s^\\frown t\\)</span> 是序列串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\upharpoonright n\">\\(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> 是长度 n 的前缀。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega\">\\(\\gamma:\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NB},\\mu_\\gamma,F_\\gamma\">\\(\\operatorname{NB},\\mu_\\gamma,F_\\gamma\\)</span> 在下式定义；后两者只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\)</span> 时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\gamma(\\langle\\rangle)=0\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\gamma(s)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\gamma(s^\\frown t)=\\gamma(s))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n)&gt;0),\\\\\n\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n)&gt;0\\},\\\\\nF_\\gamma(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha))-1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\gamma(\\langle\\rangle)=0\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\gamma(s)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\gamma(s^\\frown t)=\\gamma(s))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n)&gt;0),\\\\\n\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n)&gt;0\\},\\\\\nF_\\gamma(\\alpha)&amp;:=\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha))-1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用有限序列本身取代原书的原始递归序列码，不改变 K* 的空串为0、正值稳定和每条分支被击中三个条件。最小值由分支条件存在，减1只作用于正值，因此输出属于自然数。不能只给稳定性而省略击中所有分支的条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s^\\frown t","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma:\\omega^{<\\omega}\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NB},\\mu_\\gamma,F_\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\gamma(\\langle\\rangle)=0\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ (\\gamma(s)>0\\Rightarrow\\gamma(s^\\frown t)=\\gamma(s))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n)>0),\\\\\n\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha)&:=\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright n)>0\\},\\\\\nF_\\gamma(\\alpha)&:=\\gamma(\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\mu_\\gamma(\\alpha))-1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1928,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-522","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"9538412e70727870","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\gamma$ 满足 [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] 的 $\\operatorname{NB}$，$F_\\gamma,\\mu_\\gamma$ 沿用；$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega$。"},{"id":"15acd2ee71b7bcb7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}